    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970424.0005\n\nTAIPEI, April 24 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nTaipei shares finish 0.6 percent higher\n\n\n\n\nShare prices in Taiwan closed 0.6 percent higher Thursday amid strong buying of financial issues, dealers said.\n\nThe Taiwan Stock Exchange weighted price index gained 52.29 points to 8,629.23.",
